        <item>
            <title>MacTR 1.3.17</title>
            <sparkle:version>1.3.17</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.3.17</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[
                <style>
                    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #333; padding: 8px; }
                    h3 { font-size: 14px; margin: 8px 0 4px; }
                    ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 4px 0; }
                    li { margin: 2px 0; }
                </style>
                <h3>v1.3.17 — lighter refresh, rewritten USB protocol layer</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li><b>Refresh interval now controls rendering only.</b> The screen is redrawn at the interval you choose (default is now 1.0 s), while the last frame keeps being sent to the LCD every 0.5 s so the panel never blanks. Less CPU at the same visual result.</li>
                    <li>The chosen refresh interval is remembered across restarts.</li>
                    <li><b>LY protocol layer rewritten</b> from a written protocol specification. The handshake now retries when the panel reports it is not ready yet, and bulk writes advance by the bytes actually transferred.</li>
                    <li>Added a LICENSE file (MIT) and the third-party BSD notice for the temperature sensor code.</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
            <pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 02:30:00 +0900</pubDate>
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/beret21/MacTR/releases/download/v1.3.17/MacTR-1.3.17.zip"
